<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Betting Lines Administration — Pressboxd</title>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:dark;font-family:system-ui,Arial,sans-serif;background:#090d16;color:#f4f6fc}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}header{padding:20px 4%;background:#151d2b;border-bottom:1px solid #36445a}a{color:#a8c9ff}
main{max-width:1350px;margin:auto;padding:22px 3% 70px}h1{font-size:25px}h2{font-size:17px}p,small{color:#a9b8cc}
.card{background:#151e2c;border:1px solid #344257;border-radius:10px;padding:18px;margin:18px 0}
select,button{font:inherit;border-radius:7px;padding:9px 12px;background:#243248;border:1px solid #4d617e;color:white}
button{background:#2757a9;cursor:pointer}button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:13px}th,td{padding:10px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid #364258;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}
.table{overflow:auto}th{white-space:nowrap}td.num{text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}.tag{display:inline-block;background:#253b58;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 6px}
.notice{padding:12px;background:#1e3b50}.error{background:#54252a}form{display:inline-block;margin-right:10px}.muted{color:#a9b8cc}
</style></head><body>
<header><a href="/betting">Betting</a> · <a href="/betsadmin/sync">DCI Sync</a> · <a href="/betsadmin">Gems Admin</a></header>
<main>
<h1>Betting Line Monitor</h1>
<p>Admin-only. <strong>Posted line</strong> is the frozen line users wager against; <strong>current projection</strong> is a fresh read-only recalculation from scores available today. No wager, balance or posted line is changed.</p>
<% if(notice){%><div class="card notice"><%=notice%></div><%}%>
<% if(error){%><div class="card notice error"><%=error%></div><%}%>
<div class="card">
<form method="get" action="/betsadmin/lines"><label for="selected">Competition</label>
<select name="event_id" id="selected" onchange="this.form.submit()">
<% events.forEach(e=>{ %><option value="<%=e.id%>" <%= selected?.id===e.id?'selected':'' %>><%= e.name %> — <%=new Date(e.start_ts*1000).toLocaleDateString()%> (<%=e.season%>)</option><% }) %>
</select><button type="submit">View</button></form>
<% if(!events.length){%><p>No upcoming competitions have been imported. Run DCI Sync first.</p><%}%>
</div>
<% if(selected){%>
<div class="card">
<h2><%=selected.name%></h2>
<p>Start: <%=new Date(selected.start_ts*1000).toLocaleString()%> · Betting <strong><%=now>=opening && now<selected.start_ts?'OPEN':'NOT OPEN'%></strong> · Opens: <%=new Date(opening*1000).toLocaleString()%></p>
<% if(isOpener){%>
<p><span class="tag">Season's first DCI competition</span> — the admin may open this event earlier than the normal schedule.</p>
<% if(!manualOpen && now<selected.start_ts && now<opening){%>
<form action="/betsadmin/lines/open" method="post" onsubmit="return confirm('Open betting for this season opener immediately? This cannot be undone.');">
<input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%=csrf%>"><input type="hidden" name="event_id" value="<%=selected.id%>">
<button type="submit">Open betting now</button></form>
<small>Requires an imported official lineup and at least one active line. Opening is permanent until the event starts.</small>
<%}else if(manualOpen){%><p>Manually opened by an administrator on <%=new Date(manualOpen.opened_ts*1000).toLocaleString()%>.</p><%}%>
<%}%>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h2>Staff change — preseason model only</h2>
<p>Private admin estimate, in overall-score points. Positive values raise the projected score; negative values lower it. The adjustment affects only this corps' <strong>first and second competitions of the season</strong>. From the third competition onward, the standard model applies. Caption projections scale the adjustment by each caption's maximum score divided by 100.</p>
<p>Saving recalculates existing lines for <strong>unopened competitions with no wagers</strong>. Once a window opens, posted lines stay locked; the live admin projection still reflects your updated modifier.</p>
<% if(participants.length){ %>
<div class="table"><table><thead><tr><th>Corps</th><th>Show #</th><th>Current staff effect</th><th>New effect (points)</th><th>Admin action</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<% participants.forEach(name=>{ %><tr>
<td><%=name%></td><td><%=staffRanks.get(name)%> <%=staffRanks.get(name)>2?'(inactive for this show)':''%></td>
<td class="num"><%=Number(staffChanges.get(name)||0).toFixed(3)%></td>
<td colspan="2"><form method="post" action="/betsadmin/lines/staff" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap">
<input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%=csrf%>"><input type="hidden" name="event_id" value="<%=selected.id%>"><input type="hidden" name="corps" value="<%=name%>">
<input type="number" name="adjustment" step="0.001" min="-10" max="10" required value="<%=Number(staffChanges.get(name)||0).toFixed(3)%>" style="max-width:115px;padding:8px;background:#202c40;color:white;border:1px solid #4d617e;border-radius:7px">
<button type="submit">Save staff change</button></form></td></tr><% }); %>
</tbody></table></div>
<small>0.000 removes the modifier. All modifications are stored by season and corps, not by individual competition.</small>
<% } else { %><p>Official lineup required before adjusting staff effects.</p><% } %>
</div>
<div class="card"><h2>All markets for this competition (<%=markets.length%>)</h2>
<div class="table"><table><thead><tr><th>Corps</th><th>Caption</th><th>Type</th><th>Status</th><th>Posted line</th><th>Current projection</th><th>Difference</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<%markets.forEach(m=>{const p=projections.get(m.id);%><tr><td><%=m.corps%></td><td><%=m.caption%></td><td><%=m.kind%></td><td><%=m.status%></td><td class="num"><%=Number(m.line).toFixed(3)%></td><td class="num"><%=p?Number(p.value).toFixed(3):'Unavailable'%></td><td class="num"><%=p?(p.delta>0?'+':'')+p.delta.toFixed(3):'—'%></td></tr><%});%>
<%if(!markets.length){%><tr><td colspan="7">No markets yet. Run schedule sync or generate lines from the verified lineup before opening betting.</td></tr><%}%>
</tbody></table></div></div>
<div class="card"><h2>Placed bets on this event (<%=bets.length%>)</h2><p>Each bet retains its original wagering line, the model projection captured when the bet was placed, and the current recalculated projection.</p>
<div class="table"><table><thead><tr><th>Bet #</th><th>User</th><th>Placed</th><th>Corps</th><th>Caption</th><th>Pick</th><th>Stake</th><th>Locked line</th><th>At placement</th><th>Current projection</th><th>Result</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<%bets.forEach(b=>{const p=projections.get(b.market_id);%><tr><td><%=b.id%></td><td><%=b.username||'User #'+b.user_id%></td><td><%=new Date(b.placed_ts*1000).toLocaleString()%></td><td><%=b.corps%></td><td><%=b.caption%> / <%=b.kind%></td><td><%=b.choice%></td><td class="num"><%=b.stake%></td><td class="num"><%=Number(b.line).toFixed(3)%></td><td class="num"><%=b.projection_at_bet==null?'Not recorded':Number(b.projection_at_bet).toFixed(3)%></td><td class="num"><%=p?Number(p.value).toFixed(3):'Unavailable'%></td><td><%=b.result%></td></tr><%});%>
<%if(!bets.length){%><tr><td colspan="11">No bets placed on this competition.</td></tr><%}%>
</tbody></table></div></div>
<small>Projection preview recalculates on page refresh. It uses the current historical-score model, is not guaranteed to predict the final result, and is never substituted into a placed bet.</small>
<%}%>
</main></body></html>
